{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6bd246d806eb5d311765e241f9e7d438bf5cdd6818c57f79d3bab017a8dbcdde",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08bc50ec9ffed1557b1033079ee04920b0ee82e40fcbfa2efa43d5cc09f3f943",
      "text": "本大爷的早间日常",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4874c892ea98d1ae1b9f987d01ab68d6f6671a105b68fdcb714a120ad95d5f6e",
      "text": "为了拍摄早间日常视频，\n涟与制作人及工作人员一同行动。\n涟一边接受制作人的照料一边前行，\n突然察觉到什么的涟猛地奔跑起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08bc50ec9ffed1557b1033079ee04920b0ee82e40fcbfa2efa43d5cc09f3f943",
      "text": "本大爷的早间日常",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35c0ca2ead137fc7217c250f4c03a9a6098805622d17deec6228636e500b96e9",
      "text": "呼……咕……呼……咕……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:404a606110f8204c15e27536653a494a98e7e95308b41f9b8d7cfd09972dc740",
      "text": "……涟先生……涟先生……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17c57f22659a9449458bb21f7e3550d7a9b3ebe1df55294972c872a5672f288d",
      "text": "嗯——……唔喵……呼……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c6afcbe651cb7d2d37702cb4fc3973d3685916ae23eebf990c35bed3d7e8429",
      "text": "快醒醒，涟先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a48208a20e833e32d26c6b986f2eed312856d77a58fded38e0a212bfc84ef694",
      "text": "唔啊啊……！干嘛啊，吵死了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a720da7dfcf42292504412f7153c449c05bda6a2632a92334c4c39f9b0965a02",
      "text": "今天是拍摄《牙崎涟的早间日常视频》的\n日子哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bbe210d01994cec5b0eef0e2486ddd60e1afaee355fc4cd8579405d0c1bb67a",
      "text": "因为碰头地点的男道拉面店没看到你，\n我和工作人员一直在找你呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf8611d089761a444d9d5ba9fda886388d0a128465605dbec836a4a2713e9aa2",
      "text": "本大爷在哪是本大爷的自由吧。\n哈啊——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:111c67ce65285b704c41c2836f28709b4d389a283b95a5072380e4a1a7c2af13",
      "text": "啊哈哈……都已经是中午了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_a:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2334f4249949831f8e95bbd628d4221890ea3b6f2999dd9228ed250ac1720cf",
      "text": "本大爷醒来的时间就是早晨。\n让太阳自己来配合我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9e57ee3d2a66f0bcf42f9eb62b90b36520cb9a2548957583d06aa64fb92d4d7",
      "text": "原来如此！那么，就把接下来的行动\n作为早间日常来拍摄吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83821c334fae59ca79a162f4b28d6604efb5721587550dbda6ecf27b02b85ca6",
      "text": "真、真是抱歉工作人员……\n今天就拜托您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70a0e4f1d143edff19d8616e57227701f6af6905369a0658a05112d45dfe66dd",
      "text": "涟先生，我来帮你整理睡翘的头发。\n还有，衣服上的褶皱也得弄平才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27dda92dde14c5f9fe3a3c02a6b9f2194e7ccf73670cde61cfdbb0b3357b5475",
      "text": "怎样都无所谓吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a812ad6f0ec9bce3a54ce0bbebab2baa858ad681e845b07755ffe4edc2a16e03",
      "text": "毕竟是偶像，\n仪表容貌还是要好好打理的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20ea0d1503fa357bf9cbf39fac516a2a99a3a0cf4a269b9d02bb0455517ee52d",
      "text": "那种事跟本大爷没关系。\n走开啦，大笨蛋。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:408fec870ae376caa176864d1b8155e573a2d5e5269fd844d28dee14b9235e85",
      "text": "比起那个……肚子饿了。\n喂，你，去弄点吃的来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:322b092e6857e0d68e222affd4971dee74223210351496202696d5c4ab1b9668",
      "text": "早餐吗。该怎么办呢？\n平时都是怎么解决的呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23e76e6d31a5b0497a112da8f7bf6d0ddfe51eb35afc9a881e27115185cef36c",
      "text": "啧，真是啰里八嗦的……\n嗯？好像有食物的香味传过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77f09b0bb2eb6e6726c81d3b47f5052516cb1c091f8eb32617e9e4dbc83f75c6",
      "text": "嗅嗅……这边吗？不对，是那边。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:570bda8242db4e5908fd4142f5aaee7e5827b746efc8307b7db3aea587b63250",
      "text": "啊！涟先生，等等！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_c:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c900e5dec567594e2e0ae952267d644338c45c2ea1cc5571ccdcddc32587dba6",
      "text": "这不有现成的好东西嘛。\n今天的早饭就是那个了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:744c24ef2ebf6ab9a888fd6a8181ec9bbeda91bf2e2568fea7c8274f2549a140",
      "text": "那是，大胃王比赛……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23cc5a4a13e26f8d71a6cd519f5b364eec130ad8597f2240362940fd56a3a059",
      "text": "正好合适。\n本大爷要全给吃光！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_c:cmd-000038:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:656e32e2e82d93ad5438c9c520255b056b106063df9203f215839fac8e48c8e2",
      "text": "再端上来啊！\n这点东西根本不够本大爷塞牙缝的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a4278e81ebe3826c6c02f26e6261de80dbe864fb48923a102d5e564c9d032a9",
      "text": "好、好厉害……！中途临时参赛的牙崎选手，\n进食速度完全没有慢下来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88a3c5873524c6d9427fa37a8015da325bcd2c6f34275c9a7c0445d5b2fb7eb5",
      "text": "啊……只剩最后一个人了！\n变成和涟先生的一对一单挑了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3f3860579cdb71c7903a983566d3a00a12d407af7576ffc7ba530ff836211b3",
      "text": "本大爷怎么可能会输！\n喂，把下一盘端上来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c43d7766cd04ecc25525e6c0f5b4231003de55ed90ea3f798f22af9cc1c07412",
      "text": "哎呀——！？夺冠热门居然在这里遗憾弃权！\n冠军是来自315 Pro的偶像，牙崎选手——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76a40c36507d7341463a0204e4108cda81d4e008d2461108050c85bcbc7c4be1",
      "text": "拿、拿到冠军了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57704e683b095ab890034f0afaed4b709929627f09384949a43cf62af57fa14a",
      "text": "哼，理所当然的吧。\n吧唧吧唧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:200e24976b9d07ad3901c3bf5f22de0429cc709a536091dc1fdfe2ae9cd12c1b",
      "text": "接下来举行颁奖典礼！\n太精彩了，牙崎选手！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_d:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1d1958999eb08468d8b6d270c9c1e77750acabc58fdf5c056e5a0d97808d769",
      "text": "由大赛主办方颁发优胜奖品的\n商品券和奖状！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:404307f7f53ae2fd639e920d6a9bf5827d527cef9ad50b0c2e36d115b05052bd",
      "text": "啊？优胜奖品？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:342a40746a2a623054eee50a1185e18cdb899c01aaa84c1b9acfbe3393a0982e",
      "text": "哼——……\n喂下仆，拿去替我收着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6f85ea039421a9a4cd27478a8efd20fe85a994a85eee5143a82129a8f57f13c",
      "text": "怎么这样，我不能收啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77041d913637d9ecf041feb826d5bc315cffb18dd03bccdf25e921bf1152b8b2",
      "text": "别搞错了。只是寄放在你那，\n用来使唤你去给本大爷买吃的而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7e036f314dcffdf69af1cbe6655063054bf0a8cdef0132a6fafb21f3c875808",
      "text": "听说那边的烂纸片是用来赞美本大爷的。\n感恩戴德地给我好好供着！库哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c2181c66cb33078dbb6a782a59623614f71a3153e16ae97b79dec38125937fa",
      "text": "原来如此。我知道了，涟先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3288d9b5889a3e7dd3463d028ad8c2aca399435504c8ce374f6f41bcb37d2a2b",
      "text": "……这样拍摄就结束了！牙崎先生，托您的福\n拍到了很棒的画面。非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f3df85f32ffc30fd687fcfd7fe695806405f8890c9a2fd3c7129f8d1e773bca",
      "text": "那真是太好了！\n今天非常感谢您。来，涟先生也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62e80e44f6d6f8b5aca1f6c4aac4b7a1ca49fba964ec5a5401c7577a25ae983c",
      "text": "哼……耳根子终于能清静了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5522211eb4247de4c045f5cf09cf3d66101ec7e42f49d8bd42e95ce757477fdc",
      "text": "涟先生，请用！这是您托我买的鲷鱼烧。\n用之前的商品券买回来的。还有就是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58a54e76d6d805f36699e36cd8cd64f3daf85656a9daf644a69c5d19d99801d4",
      "text": "早间日常视频好像已经制作完成了。\n我们一起来确认一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:161e85961aefebd661ce08e8b5712220695d512213d74059a8f3c0bc3d3d68e3",
      "text": "听说做得很棒哦。一边吃鲷鱼烧\n一边看吧！饮料也准备好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aab6193d80906e4b4e96dc7d98bb7e256699a2ac8c5640cd9ebcb045892a6800",
      "text": "我才没兴趣……\n你自己一个人看去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:380c76ad004406bec85d8afd99bbf2c47a4c635c58f7bf9bbb5832c8189191b1",
      "text": "别这么说嘛。\n那么，我播放了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07970a66fcc02e643d933fe2ece07dcc2c03d3ecd9bc2f3924972591c147d8fd",
      "text": "“本大爷醒来的时间就是早晨。\n让太阳自己来配合我！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5091307f8dc2c3c6666034595a03ee73767bff4f8eaba27dbbf3148b8b96d433",
      "text": "在舒适宜人的气候中醒来，偶像牙崎涟……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbaeb6ded95f52fa7fe190f137e19f195e188c40d15206c619f10c1a3c30798c",
      "text": "“这不有现成的好东西嘛。\n今天的早饭就是那个了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdaba513d717c5c1e032b17be32517ae0f0fd513e48f1025dd92da07211f8fa5",
      "text": "偶然发现的大赛，惊喜参与其中。\n作为处于成长期的偶像，牙崎大显身手……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1556f392b7533837b822808066ac4f0c8d7a608e5ef7474465ba235f596c8871",
      "text": "“喂，拿去替我收着”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0512880082cba3d7cbdab4a999bf4eeec08ec78ba7ba12817e41fac9cac357b3",
      "text": "在胜利与喝彩声中享用完早餐的他，\n将生活费的管理全权托付给了信任的对象……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2b2cb881fbfbecb1124e678bf42231d331de622f2ec8b6a798820d69b0cdd95",
      "text": "偶像牙崎涟的早晨，便是如此豪放磊落……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:402219735fecb29f26c039a1c17f14837874aa3eae532746981d52c1865d181f",
      "text": "感觉成品剪辑得相当前卫时髦呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac9c1ec14bf640c20c3b9e42f1533771a25cc9463403178a680d6455060d6f00",
      "text": "哼！马马虎虎算干得不错嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_040ren_01_1_2_040_01:1_2_040_01_e:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:342d4ace080f20d23a9d1bad9dd6503d4270b774d8bccd89fe4deefe8c28d78b",
      "text": "这样一来本大爷是最强大天才这件事，\n又要传遍全世界了！库哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
